<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT KAPALUA INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT KAPALUA INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>KAPALUA, Hawaii 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores at the</p>
<p>rain-plagued Kapalua International golf tournament on Friday,</p>
<p>where second-round play was suspended due to darkness (two</p>
<p>courses used, leaders listed in relation to par, U.S. unless</p>
<p>noted):</p>
<p> 1. Steve Jones	     11 under par (Finished 18 Friday)</p>
<p> 1. Bob Gilder	     -11	   F</p>
<p> 3. Fred Couples	   -10	  17</p>
<p> 3. Davis Love III	 -10	  17</p>
<p> 3. Billy Mayfair	  -10	   F</p>
<p> 3. Paul Stankowski	-10	   F</p>
<p> 7. Peter Jacobsen	  -9	   F</p>
<p> 7. Scott McCarron	  -9	   F</p>
<p> 9. Woody Austin	    -8	   F</p>
<p> 9. Mike Hulbert	    -8	   F</p>
<p> 9. Sandy Lyle (Britain)  -8	   F</p>
</text>
